OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after cyclist seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 31-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a cyclist was left seriously
OL,8,Finjured in a crash with a van, police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FEmergency crews were called to a
OL,12,Fcollision at the junction of Newark
OL,13,FRoad and St Aiden's Road in North
OL,14,FHykeham shortly before 17:40 BST on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,17,FThe rider of the bike, aged in his 60s,
OL,18,Fwas taken to hospital with serious
OL,19,Finjuries, Lincolnshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
