OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after cyclist seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe arrested man has since been
OL,7,Freleased under investigation, the force
OL,8,Fadded, with police continuing to appeal
OL,9,Ffor witnesses or those with video
OL,10,Ffootage to come forward.
